# Context loading

Load context in this order:
1. mission/task packet;
2. root `AGENTS.md`;
3. repository architecture/source-of-truth docs named by the packet;
4. relevant local code;
5. external docs only when the task requires them.

Do not recursively ingest the whole repository unless needed.
Do not let stale notes override a named governing source.
When context is missing, mark the gap and ask/hold rather than inventing state.
